  "description": "The shared foundation layer for the entire OASIS ecosystem -- OASISResult/OASISResultCollectionWithPagination result types, shared constants, extension methods, cross-cutting error handling, and utility helpers relied upon by every other OASIS NuGet package. A transitive dependency of all OASIS packages. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://oasisomniverse.one",
